            <ArticleTitle>[Small bowel diverticulitis: the role of CT].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of small bowel diverticulitis diagnosed by computed tomography. They describe the CT findings and review its advantages for diagnosis of this uncommon entity that is rarely suspected at physical examination.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
